  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the grill to medium-high (see Make it yours). Line a large oven tray with foil. Coarsely grate the cheddar and parmesan. Halve the tomato lengthwise, then thinly slice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715189/photos/large/67333_1-b3eb91093a72a902f0ade38e244e4754.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make cheese mixture: Put the cheddar, parmesan and oregano in a bowl, season with pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715190/photos/large/67333_2-b6fc02cbbc00022e3093919563c4d0d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble flatbreads: Put 2 pitas on the lined tray. Scatter over half the cheese mixture. Top with the tomato, then scatter over the remaining cheese mixture.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715191/photos/large/67333_3-99c4530f2cc7ffaafdf23da19c4e25d8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill flatbreads: Grill the flatbreads for 5-6 mins until golden and the cheese is melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715192/photos/large/67333_4-ccb870028a7f7a10b120afa67b4cfdab.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Combine the pesto and 1 tsp red wine vinegar in a bowl, then drizzle over the flatbreads. Cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715193/photos/large/67333_5-d81a87bad4b4aafe422d8628eaa8ce5d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Like even crispier flatbreads? Grilling them is fast and easy, but if you'd prefer a crunchier base, cook them in a 220C oven for 10-12 mins until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/715194/photos/large/67333_6-94efe979a1b5e54aaf7874e9e536bf30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
